Package: toolfetch
Title: Browse and Install Tools from jackspepper/tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jack", "Pepper", email = "jack@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Lists top-level tool folders in the jackspepper/tools GitHub
    repository, lets the user pick one interactively, and downloads it into
    the current working directory. Maintains a local cache of the repo's
    folder listing that refreshes weekly (or on demand) so repeated calls
    don't hit the GitHub API every time.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
